<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Oct 14.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Oct 14.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twenty highest dividend yields for Australian companies included in the 320-share All Ordinaries Index based on closing prices on October 11.</p>
<p>Dividends based on rolling 12 months.</p>
<p>Yields are not grossed up for franking credits.</p>
<p>				     Dividend</p>
<p>Rank Name		    Yield     Close</p>
<p>1  Prime Credit Tr	 10.21     0.96</p>
<p>2  McIntosh Sec	    10.00     0.90</p>
<p>3  Prop Income Inv	  9.86     1.03</p>
<p>4  Indu Property	    9.78     0.93</p>
<p>5  BT Prop Trust	    9.60     1.70</p>
<p>6  Villa World		9.57     1.15</p>
<p>7  Aust Tour		  8.93     0.84</p>
<p>8  Colonial Mutual	  8.89     1.19</p>
<p>9  Centro Prop		8.71     2.24</p>
<p>10 Central Equity	   8.65     1.04</p>
<p>11 Equitilink		 8.47     0.59</p>
<p>12 Westpac Prop Tr	  8.47     1.60</p>
<p>13 Armstrong Retail	 8.46     0.78</p>
<p>14 Advance Pro CB	   8.41     1.38</p>
<p>15 Barclays Mirvac	  8.40     1.31</p>
<p>16 Gandel Retail Tr	 8.39     0.93</p>
<p>17 Gen Prop Tr		8.38     2.40</p>
